Screen Open 0,320,200,32,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
For I=0 To 31 : Ink I : Bar (I mod 8)*40,(I/8)*50 To (I mod 8)*40+39,(I/8)*50+49 : Next I
For I=0 To 31 : Colour I,I*$111+I : Next I
A$="" : For I=0 To 31 : A$=A$+Hex$(Colour(I))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Palette $F00,$0F0,,,$00F,-1,$FFF : Colour 31,$ABC : Colour 17,-1 : Colour 40,$FED
A$="" : For I=0 To 31 : A$=A$+Hex$(Colour(I))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Colour Back $123
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/colours_1.iff"
Fade 1,$111,$222,,$444 : Wait 40
A$="" : For I=0 To 31 : A$=A$+Hex$(Colour(I))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Fade 1 : Wait 40
A$="" : For I=0 To 31 : A$=A$+Hex$(Colour(I))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Fade 2 To 0 : Wait 60
A$="" : For I=0 To 31 : A$=A$+Hex$(Colour(I))+" " : Next I : Print #1,A$
Flash 3,"(5A5,1)" : Flash 20,"( 6 b 7 , 2 )" : Wait 5 : Print #1,Hex$(Colour(3));" ";Hex$(Colour(20))
Flash 3,"" : Flash 20,"" : Flash Off
Trap Flash 1,"(FFF,0)" : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Flash 1,"(FFG,5)" : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Flash 1,"(FFF,5) (000,5)" : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Flash 1,"(FFF,5)x" : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Flash 1,"(FFF,-3)" : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Flash 1,"(FFF,5" : Print #1,Errtrap
For I=1 To 17 : Trap Flash I,"(FFF,5)(000,5)" : Print #1,Errtrap; : Next I : Print #1,""
Flash Off
Trap Shift Up 1,5,2,1 : Print #1,Errtrap
Trap Shift Down 1,2,5,0 : Print #1,Errtrap
Shift Off
Screen Open 1,320,100,4,Lowres : Curs Off : Cls 0 : Flash 1,"(F0F,1)" : Wait 3 : Print #1,Hex$(Colour(1))
Screen Close 1 : Print #1,Hex$(Colour(3))
Print #1,"end"
